-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This licence covers the AstraOS project's own material:

  * the build system and scripts (scripts/, config/, Makefile)
  * the AstraOS packages (packages/astraos-*)
  * the desktop and system configuration (desktop/, system/, installer/)
  * the AstraOS artwork (branding/)

It does NOT cover the upstream software that AstraOS distributes. AstraOS is a
distribution: it includes hundreds of third-party packages, each with its own
copyright and licence. Those are recorded on an installed system at

  /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright

For a summary of the upstream components and their licences, see
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and run `astraos-release-info`.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHERE THE FULL LICENSE TEXT LIVES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The complete text of the GNU General Public License version 3 is not duplicated in
this repository, because every Debian-derived system already ships it. On an AstraOS
(or Debian, or Ubuntu) system:

  /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3

Online: <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html>

If you are reading this in a checkout and want the text without a Debian system
available, that URL is the authoritative source.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AstraOS is an independent distribution based on Debian GNU/Linux.

  Debian GNU/Linux    https://www.debian.org/legal/licenses/
  Linux kernel        GPL-2.0-only (with the standard syscall exception)
  Xfce                https://www.xfce.org/
  LightDM             GPL-3.0-or-later
  Plymouth            GPL-2.0-or-later
  GRUB                GPL-3.0-or-later
  Calamares           GPL-3.0-or-later
  DejaVu fonts        Bitstream Vera licence (redistributable)

AstraOS is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official release of the Debian
Project. "Debian" is a registered trademark of Software in the Public Interest, Inc.,
and is used here only to describe the upstream base accurately.

AstraOS includes no proprietary assets. No logo, icon or trademark from another
operating system is redistributed. All AstraOS artwork in branding/ was created for
this project.

Third-party fonts referenced by the wordmark and the desktop theme are dependencies
(fonts-dejavu-core), not bundled files.
